        "@value": "Indexical Memory",
        "@language": "en"
      },
      "skos:notation": "AUG-0045",
      "skos:definition": {
        "@value": "A longitudinal shift of the remembering function from retaining content itself toward retaining where and how the content can be retrieved through AI, reflecting a change in how a person manages personal knowledge under sustained AI use.",
        "@language": "en"
